          %h2#references References
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              Wikipedia,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gram%E2%80%93Schmidt_process"} Gram-Schmidt process
              %em
                %a{:href => "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/QR_decomposition"} QR decomposition
          %p
            The formulation of Gram-Schmidt via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gaussian+elimination"} Gaussian elimination
            is due to
          %ul
            %li#PursellTrimble91
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lyle+E.+Pursell"}> Lyle E. Pursell
              , S. Y. Trimble,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization by Gauss elimination
              %strong 98
              6 (1991) 544–549 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1080/00029890.1991.11995755"}> doi:10.1080/00029890.1991.11995755
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://www.jstor.org/stable/2324877"} jstor:2324877
          %p
            Evident generalization to the case of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/indefinite+bilinear+form"} indefinite
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/inner+product+spaces"} inner product spaces
          %ul
